Package: pos13f
Title: Institutional Positioning Factors from SEC Form 13F Filings
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Paulo", "Guimarães", , "pauloguimaraes871@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Ingests the SEC Form 13F data sets, builds a point-in-time
    institutional breadth-change factor and backtests it on liquid US
    equities with explicit trading costs.
